00:04:57.020 --> 00:05:00.480
The technical setup requires the 14-day RSI

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:04.740
to hold above 45 and a close above the 50-day moving average

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:08.660
with volume at least 1.2 times the 20-day average.

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:11.840
Risk assessment shows the upgrade could fade

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:14.720
