00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:18.420
So there is no entry until closing price confirmation.

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:21.880
This setup demonstrates the discipline of waiting

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.740
for closing price confirmation

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:26.600
before committing capital to an analyst revision.

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:29.180
Directly applying the recurring lesson

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:32.020
that single-day momentum often reverses.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:35.280
Listeners learn to define explicit trigger levels

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:37.620
rather than reacting to headline upgrades.

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:40.680
We will continue monitoring into next week

00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:44.260
and only initiate once the closing price criteria are met.

